WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
At shift opening, select the Open scope, then combine the urgent priority shortcut with Unassigned.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:13.440
Read the result as an intersection: a blank list does not mean that every urgent ticket has an owner in every scope.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:19.960
Clear the filters, switch to Owners, and inspect the primary owner on the individual ticket before handing it over.
